# Engineering rules (always on)

**Full contract:** [`docs/ENGINEERING_RULES.md`](docs/ENGINEERING_RULES.md)
**Invariants:** [`docs/INVARIANTS.md`](docs/INVARIANTS.md)
**Auth:** [`docs/CLERK-AUTH.md`](docs/CLERK-AUTH.md)

This repo is aadm.io. Marketing and member chrome are Astro. Field after login is a React island at `/field/main` on the same deploy. The website never invents domain truth.

## Non-negotiables

- Backend (and Clerk session) are authoritative. No client-invented success, workspace, or version.
- No domain logic in Astro pages or the Field React shell. Call the backend; render parsed replies.
- Sign-in is `accounts.aadm.io` only. Satellite off. Do not embed Clerk `<SignIn>` / `<SignUp>`. Do not repoint the CNAME.
- No secrets in the browser bundle. `PUBLIC_*` only. Member credentials stay on `/member`.
- IDs are server UUIDs from replies. Never mint or derive them.
- TEN-07 families are distinct screens. Field is not a dashboard (FLD-01–04).

## Before merging

1. Read the matching heading in `docs/ENGINEERING_RULES.md` and the invariant ID in `docs/INVARIANTS.md`.
2. Auth changes: read `docs/CLERK-AUTH.md` first.
